---
import Section from './Section.astro';

const layers = [
  {
    name: 'Record',
    detail: 'A machine answers for its own past, on the machine, with no server in the path.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Execution',
    detail: 'It moves five kinds of work: agents, signals, machines, people, and outside systems.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Judgement',
    detail: 'It governs the other two: which model answers, at what cost, and on which terms.',
  },
];
---

<Section
  id="company"
  label="Company"
  title="Ktema Systems"
  lede="Ktema Systems builds the infrastructure for accountable agentic computing, from a chip with no operating system to a data center. Ktema is the deterministic storage engine; Kletos executes the work; Krisis governs what the work may do; and Delta is the Single Space Agentic AI Operation Platform."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Three layers share one record: Ktema keeps it, Kletos moves the work, and Krisis governs what
      the other two do. The deterministic engine is the core, and each layer stands on its own. Delta
      is the Single Space Agentic AI Operation Platform over them.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards cards--3">
    {
      layers.map((layer) => (
        <div class="card">
          <span class="card__value">{layer.name}</span>
          <p>{layer.detail}</p>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class="note">We work with design partners. Write to us.</p>
</Section>
